  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Circle N has a radius of <math alttext=\"7\"><mn>7</mn>\n</math> millimeters <math alttext=\"left parenthesis mm right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mtext>mm</mtext></mfenced></math>. Circle M has an area of&nbsp;<math alttext=\"64 pi m m squared\"><mn>64</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mm</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>. What is the total area, in <math alttext=\"m m squared\"><msup><mi>mm</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>, of circles N and M?</p>",
